<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Technical Appendix: Algorithm description and theoretical analysis</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix collects algorithm pseudocode, and a theoretical analysis and comparison against other loss functions.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>APML Algorithm Summary</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The computation of the Adaptive Probabilistic Matching Loss for a batch of predicted point sets <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{X}</annotation></semantics></math> and ground truth point sets <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math> is summarized in Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="In A.1 APML Algorithm Summary ‣ Appendix A Technical Appendix: Algorithm description and theoretical analysis ‣ APML: Adaptive Probabilistic Matching Loss for Robust 3D Point Cloud Reconstruction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. This procedure includes pairwise cost computation, adaptive softmax with bidirectional matching, Sinkhorn normalization, and final loss evaluation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm">
<div id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.3.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>Predicted point sets <math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times N\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times N\times d}</annotation></semantics></math>, Ground truth point sets <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times M\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times M\times d}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.3.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>Hyperparameters: <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\text{min}},\delta,\epsilon_{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>min</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\text{min}},\delta,\epsilon_{g}</annotation></semantics></math> (adaptive softmax); <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{\text{iter}},\varepsilon_{\text{stab}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>iter</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mtext>stab</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{\text{iter}},\varepsilon_{\text{stab}}</annotation></semantics></math> (Sinkhorn)
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.3.3.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span>Loss value <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{APML}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>APML</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{APML}}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.4" class="ltx_listingline">Initialize total loss: <math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{total}}\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{total}}\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.3.5" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.3.5.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b\leftarrow 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b\leftarrow 1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.3.5.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.3.5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
